From 4ad65eecbee05d1988909da425b787907b92a0c1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: songliyong <songliyong@contributor>


Date: Tue, 29 Apr 2025 19:30:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] USERSTORY admin port and local socket use per thread

Issue:
--------
When active threads are used up, threadpool may not be able to process
new connections immediately. So the user connnection will be hunged.

Solution:
--------
To avoid threadpool in some emergency scenarios, We support admin port
connection or local socket use per thread instead of threadpool.

This patch introduces three variables.
1.rds_admin_max_connections: The max number of connections on admin port, only limit the total number
  of connections from admin port. Independent of the max_connections parameter.
  max_connections only limits the max connections from normal user connection.
2.rds_admin_port_using_per_thread: It indicates whether admin port connection using per thread
3.rds_local_socket_using_per_thread: It indicates whether local socket connection using per thread
